	(gr_text "REAR PLATE (USB). X-mirrored vs front (outside view). Non-functional enclosure end plate.\nOutline 88x38 R4.5; M3 corner holes Ø3.4 @ +/-41,+/-14.21 (plate screws on, full face).\nUSB 3.0 opening 12.5x12.9 centered at plate (25.04, 15.49).\nSTATUS hole Ø2.0 at plate (44.0, 9.0) to view the D3 LED (body-center aligned via the fit-check; D3 3D model +0.5 Z).\nplate Y from floor edge Y=0, +Y = up. Dimensions dialed in against the 3D fit-check; open in KiCad 10 to confirm."
